{"id":"645223","name":"菠菜拌黄豆","author":"夏家妈妈的美食","authorId":"7306099","desc":"","cover":"images/645223/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"菠菜","amount":"1斤"},{"name":"黄豆","amount":"3两"}],"sub":[{"name":"熟芝麻","amount":"2勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"菠菜洗净备用。","img":"images/645223/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"煮熟的黄豆备用。","img":"images/645223/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"菠菜焯熟后过凉水，切碎备用。","img":"images/645223/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将黄豆放入菠菜内，加入生抽，蒸鱼豉油，香油拌匀。","img":"images/645223/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再加入熟芝麻拌匀即可。","img":"images/645223/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"将拌好的菠菜，黄豆放入小碗内压实。","img":"images/645223/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"最后倒扣在叠子内。","img":"images/645223/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"一盘完美的下酒菜即可食用。","img":"images/645223/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}